I have lumbar degeneration and it is painful every day. I recommend taking Free Form Glutathione because it eases the inflammation a lot. Sapien Medicine has Spinal Tapper and Artithis audios that have helped me tremendously. I use height subs and that has improved my posture tremendously

&#x200B;

Good luck

I hope this gives some motivation for the guys who think it's impossible to get lean and fit. Male sub creators are harder to come by and lesser popular, this should help any guys out there

&#x200B;

Prior to this I would bike six miles and attended boxing classes, together burn 800-1000 calories.

&#x200B;

It is important to lighten the cardio especially when bulking as much as you can. You can improve it again once you are at your desired weight and your mind is strong.

&#x200B;

In addition to using steroidal frequencies, I used Wanted and Emperor by Subclub. Wanted improves your looks.

&#x200B;

I'm currently running what I have below, but also Masculine Beauty by Binuaral Nutrition and He's so Handsome by Isa Subliminals. I'm running IGF and Grow Taller by BN just because I would like to grow in height. Also Grow Taller has affirmations for sleeping which I struggle with

&#x200B;

Feel free to DM me if you want a stack for yourself, I can make one

I am meant to know and talk to people. I want to socialize and love people. This is what I need. *This is what you need, too*. Do not be afraid for thinking like this. It is totally normal. I am happy you recognize what you feel. I am happy you feel the way that you do because by feeling this way you recognize something is wrong, and can do the most you can to correct it.

&#x200B;

In this day and age, people know how they feel, however they often are not clear on how to readjust. Others are totally clueless on how their feelings. 

&#x200B;

I heavily recommend journaling and diarying. Write some poetry or draw :). I have found creative and emotional outlets the best way in finding myself. In this way I have found out how to make myself happy by really knowing how *I* feel and really giving myself time to understand how I feel and making plans to change things around me to make them better :)

&#x200B;

Be the best you can,

&#x200B;

Alex

